You breathe a wave of dead maggots in a cone of radius [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)]. Any target caught in the area will take [168, 217, 254, 285, 311 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] blight damage and be infected with a crippling disease for 10 turns.

Crippling disease slows creatures by [9%, 24%, 34%, 40%, 44% (TL1-5)] and deals [13, 16, 19, 21, 23 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] blight damage per turn.

The damage will increase with your Magic, and the critical chance is based on your Spell crit rate.
